{"id":"en_just-a-mechanic-way-too-powerful","title":"Just a Mechanic — Way Too Powerful","titleEn":"Just a Mechanic — Way Too Powerful","description":"Luther, once a celebrated figure in racing, has settled into a quiet life as a technology supervisor—until his own protégé, Charlie, sets him up and forces him out. A chance turn leads him to Seraphina's company, where his expertise helps her secure a vital victory over the very firm that cast him aside. In the aftermath, she reveals she is pregnant. Wilma and Charlie keep plotting against them, but Luther remains at Seraphina's side through every new crisis, and his loyalty gradually earns her love.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/just-a-mechanic-way-too-powerful/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/just-a-mechanic-way-too-powerful/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Feel-Good","Hidden Master","Lady Boss","Alpha Female CEO","Male","One Night Stand"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diozy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_just-a-mechanic-way-too-powerful_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diozy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_just-a-mechanic-way-too-powerful_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diozy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_just-a-mechanic-way-too-powerful_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diozy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_just-a-mechanic-way-too-powerful_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumbl